  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Union Sirba Sesame Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to strengthen the Unions management and technical capabilities; build drying hangars; rehabilitate 3 warehouses; and purchase production inputs to enable union members to produce high quality sesame which can be marketed in country and abroad.</narrative>
  </description>
